# <%= current_page.data.title %>

> Naming: **I**PROXY = **inbound** proxy, **O**PROXY = **outbound** proxy. GOV.UK Notify uses **OPROXY**.

## What it is

| Item | Value |
|---|---|
| VM | `MPDIMZOPROXY01.cp.cjs.hmcts.net` — RHEL 7.4 (2018 image), `Standard_E4s_v3`, no zone |
| IP / subnet | 10.200.75.28 · `SN-MPD-IMZ-VPN-OUTBOUND-PROXY-01` · NSG `NS-MPD-IMZ-OUTBOUND` |
| Public IP | `IP-MPD-IMZ-OPROXY-01` = **51.11.187.252** (only edge VM with a public IP) |
| Egress | Direct to the internet from the VM's own public IP. **Not via the Barracuda NGF**: no route table or NAT gateway on the subnet, squid has no parent proxy, and no traffic to the NGF in 30 days |
| Software | squid 3128 (role `sdlc_outproxy`), HTTP disabled, allowlist `api.notifications.service.gov.uk` |

## What it's used for

- Outbound HTTPS from CP (legacy `cpp-context-notification-notify`) to GOV.UK Notify.
- General `outgoing.proxy` for CP services.

## Network flow

```
┌─ Crime Live tenant (CP) ───────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 1. CP AKS pods — notification-notify (10.232.x)                        │
│      │  HTTP proxy → MPDIMZOPROXY01.cp.cjs.hmcts.net:3128              │
│      ▼                                                                 │
│ 2. MPDIMZOPROXY01 (10.200.75.28) — squid                               │
│      │  allowlist: api.notifications.service.gov.uk only               │
│      ▼                                                                 │
│ 3. Public IP 51.11.187.252                                             │
└──────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
       ║  Internet (HTTPS 443)
┌──────▼─ GOV.UK Notify ─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 4. api.notifications.service.gov.uk (CloudFront)                       │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## How it's managed

| Item | Detail |
|---|---|
| VM IaC | `cpp-automation-terraform` `60-virtual_machines.tf` (`vm_outbound_proxy`) |
| Squid config | Ansible `sp-ansible/group_vars/50_role_sdlc_outproxy.yml`, role `roles/squid` |
| App toggle | `cpp-aks-deploy` `prd/common.yaml.j2`: `outgoing.proxy.host = MPDIMZOPROXY01.cp.cjs.hmcts.net`, port 3128; `gov.notify.proxy.enabled=true` (prp / prd / prx) |
| Backup | ✅ Daily, 30-day retention |
| Monitoring | Dynatrace OneAgent (installed on the VM and running) |

